  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ccd63a6b3612ff5e0e849bd23e47ad7c2ba3fdc201b31bcdd9d84da5dd677f4e.png] \n\nGiven that: \n\n \n \n\n \n \nSymbol\n\n \n \n \nA\n\n \n \n \nB\n\n \n \n \nC\n\n \n \n \nD\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nMeaning\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\nAfter replacing the symbols with their meanings in each option.\n\nOption 1) 96 C 12 B 2 D (42 A 6) D 3 C 20 \n\n96 + 12 × 2 - (42 ÷ 6) - 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 + 12 × 2 - (__**42 ÷ 6)**__ - 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 + __**12 × 2**__ - 7 - 3 + 20\n\n→ __**96 + 24**__ - __**7**____** - 3**__ + 20\n\n→ 120 - 10 + 20\n\n→ 130 ≠ 113\n\nOption 2) 96 C 12 A 2 D (42 A 6) A 3 D 20 \n\n96 + 12 ÷ 2 - (42 ÷ 6) ÷ 3 - 20\n\n→ 96 + __**12 ÷ 2**__ - (__**42 ÷ 6**__) ÷ 3 - 20\n\n→ 96 + 6 - __**7**____** ÷ 3**__ - 20\n\n→ 96 + 6 - 2.33 - 20\n\n→ 79.63 ≠ 113\n\nOption 3) 96 D 12 A 2 C (42 B 6) A 3 C 20 \n\n96 - 12 ÷ 2 + (42 × 6) ÷ 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 - __12 ÷ 2__ + (__**42 × 6**__) ÷ 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 - 6 + 252 ÷ 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 - 6 + 84 + 20\n\n→ 194 ≠ 113\n\n**Option 4) 96 D 12 B 2 C(42 A 6) B 3 C 20 **\n\n96 - 12 × 2 + (42 ÷ 6) × 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 - 12 × 2 + (__**42 ÷ 6**__) × 3 + 20\n\n→ 96 - __**12 × 2**__ + __**7 × 3**__ + 20\n\n→ 96 - 24 + 21 + 20\n\n**→ 113 = 113**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 4\".**",
